#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Ka tabbata kana son share duk sakamakon Tasha zuwa MAC zuwa IP daga tsarin?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete the expired Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Ka tabbata kana son share sakamakon Tasha zuwa MAC zuwa IP da suka ƙare yanzu?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to purge the cached Mactrack scanning functions?"
msgstr "Ka tabbata kana son tsaftace ayyukan binciken Mactrack da aka adana na wucin gadi?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Ka tabbata kana son share duk sakamakon Haɗaɗɗiyar Tasha zuwa MAC zuwa IP daga tsarin?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete and recreate all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Ka tabbata kana son sharewa da sake ƙirƙirar duk sakamakon Haɗaɗɗiyar Tasha zuwa MAC zuwa IP daga tsarin?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to download and import the IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI database now?"
msgstr "Ka tabbata kana son saukewa da shigo da rumbun adana bayanai na IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI yanzu?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to rebuild the scan date list from the stored Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Ka tabbata kana son sake gina jerin ranakun bincike daga sakamakon Port zuwa MAC zuwa IP da aka adana yanzu?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Rebuild and analyze the partition containing the latest port observation, which is the current week with weekly partitions. An unpartitioned table is optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped while this runs. Continue?"
msgstr "Sake ginawa da nazarin ɓangaren da ke ɗauke da lura da tasha ta baya-bayan nan, wadda ita ce makon yanzu tare da rabe-raben mako-mako. Ana inganta teburin da ba a raba ba gaba ɗaya. Ana tsallake binciken da aka tsara yayin da wannan ke gudana. A ci gaba?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Run this maintenance off hours. The rebuild copies the full history of the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables one after the other and can take hours. Scheduled scans are skipped, database maintenance waits, and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message until it finishes. Allow free disk space for a second copy of each table and its indexes. Continue?"
msgstr "Gudanar da wannan gyara bayan sa'o'in aiki. Sake ginawa yana kwafar cikakken tarihin teburan tasha (adireshin MAC), adireshin IP da 802.1x ɗaya bayan ɗaya kuma yana iya ɗaukar sa'o'i. Za a tsallake binciken da aka tsara, gyaran rumbun bayanai zai jira, kuma binciken MAC, IP da 802.1x zai nuna saƙon gyara har sai an gama. Ka tanadi sararin diski don kwafi na biyu na kowane tebur da fihirisarsa. Ci gaba?"

