#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "The port, IP and 802.1x tables are being repartitioned, or a rebuild did not finish, so their history cannot be changed now. Try again when cli/upgrade_partitioning.php has finished."
msgstr "Ana sake rarraba teburan tashar haɗi (port), IP da 802.1x, ko kuma sake ginawa bai ƙare ba, don haka ba za a iya canza tarihinsu yanzu ba. Sake gwadawa idan cli/upgrade_partitioning.php ya ƙare."

#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "MacTrack is in maintenance mode for IP address, MAC address and 802.1x searching while its history tables are repartitioned. Results are incomplete until the partitioning has finished."
msgstr "MacTrack tana cikin yanayin gyara don binciken adireshin IP, adireshin MAC da 802.1x yayin da ake sake rarraba teburan tarihinta. Sakamakon bai cika ba har sai an gama rarrabawar."

#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "MacTrack is in maintenance mode for IP address, MAC address and 802.1x searching because the partitioning of its history tables did not finish. Results are incomplete. Run cli/upgrade_partitioning.php again to resume it."
msgstr "MacTrack tana cikin yanayin gyara don binciken adireshin IP, adireshin MAC da 802.1x saboda rarraba teburan tarihinta bai ƙare ba. Sakamakon bai cika ba. Sake gudanar da cli/upgrade_partitioning.php don ci gaba da shi."

