#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Database Administration"
msgstr "Gudanar da Rumbun Bayanai"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes expired Port to MAC to IP associations from the database.  Only records that have expired, based upon your criteria are removed."
msgstr "Yana share haɗin Port zuwa MAC zuwa IP da suka ƙare daga rumbun bayanai.  Bayanan da suka ƙare kaɗai, bisa ƙa'idodinka, za a cire."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Refresh IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI Database"
msgstr "Sabunta Rumbun Bayanai na MAC/OUI na Masu Ƙera IEEE"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "This function will download and install the latest OIU database from the IEEE Website.  Each Network Interface Card (NIC) has a MAC Address.  The MAC Address can be broken into two parts.  The first part of the MAC Address contains the Vendor MAC.  The Vendor MAC identifies who manufactured the part.  This will be helpful in spot checking for rogue devices on your network."
msgstr "Wannan aikin zai sauke kuma ya shigar da sabon rumbun adana bayanai na OIU daga Shafin Yanar Gizo na IEEE. Kowane Katin Haɗin Sadarwa (NIC) yana da Adireshin MAC. Ana iya raba Adireshin MAC zuwa kashi biyu. Sashe na farko na Adireshin MAC yana ƙunshe da MAC na Mai Ƙera. MAC na Mai Ƙera yana gano wanda ya ƙera sashin. Wannan zai taimaka wajen gano na'urorin da ba su da izini akan hanyar sadarwarku."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes old and potentially stale Mactrack scanning functions from the drop-down you receive when you edit a device type."
msgstr "Yana share tsofaffin ayyukan binciken Mactrack waɗanda ƙila sun tsufa daga jerin zaɓin da kake samu lokacin da kake gyara nau'in na'ura."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes <strong>ALL</strong> Port to MAC to IP associations from the database all IP Addresses, IP Ranges, and VLANS.  This utility is good when you want to start over.  <strong>DANGER: All prior data is deleted.</strong>"
msgstr "Yana share <strong>DUKKAN</strong> haɗin Port zuwa MAC zuwa IP daga rumbun bayanai, da dukkan Adiresoshin IP, Jeri na IP, da VLANS.  Wannan kayan aiki yana da kyau idan kana son farawa sabo.  <strong>HAƊARI: Za a share dukkan bayanan baya.</strong>"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds the list of scan dates from the stored Port to MAC to IP results, reading each partition once. Scans and maintenance keep the list current, so this is only needed after results were removed outside of maintenance, for example by deleting devices."
msgstr "Yana sake gina jerin kwanakin bincike daga sakamakon Tasha zuwa MAC zuwa IP da aka ajiye, yana karanta kowane ɓangare sau ɗaya. Bincike da kulawa suna kiyaye jerin sabuntawa, don haka ana buƙatar wannan ne kawai bayan an cire sakamako a wajen kulawa, misali ta hanyar share na'urori."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "View Partition Status"
msgstr "Duba Matsayin Ɓangaren Ma'ajiya"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Shows how the Port to MAC to IP results are partitioned, the partition size in use and why, and what the last database maintenance did."
msgstr "Yana nuna yadda aka raba sakamakon Port zuwa MAC zuwa IP, girman rabon da ake amfani da shi da dalilinsa, da kuma abin da gyaran rumbun bayanai na ƙarshe ya yi."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds and analyzes only the partition containing the latest port observation to reclaim deleted space; with weekly partitions that is the current week. Unpartitioned tables are optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped until it finishes."
msgstr "Yana sake ginawa da nazarin ɓangaren da ke ɗauke da lura da tasha ta baya-bayan nan kawai don dawo da sararin da aka share; tare da rabe-raben mako-mako wannan shi ne makon yanzu. Ana inganta teburan da ba a raba ba gaba ɗaya. Ana tsallake binciken da aka tsara har sai ya ƙare."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Choose daily or weekly partitions, or disable partitioning, for the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables. The rebuild copies the full history in the background; scheduled scans are skipped and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message meanwhile."
msgstr "Zaɓi rabon yau da kullum ko na mako-mako, ko ka kashe rabawa, don teburan tasha (adireshin MAC), adireshin IP da 802.1x. Sake ginawa yana kwafar cikakken tarihin a baya; ana tsallake binciken da aka tsara kuma binciken MAC, IP da 802.1x yana nuna saƙon gyara a halin yanzu."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Aggregated Table Administration"
msgstr "Gudanar da Haɗaɗɗen Tebur"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes ALL <strong>Aggregated</strong> (Not Scan Results) Port to MAC to IP associations from the database.  Data will again be collected on the basis of <strong>only new</strong> scanned data in the next mactrack poller run."
msgstr "Yana share DUKKAN haɗin Port zuwa MAC zuwa IP <strong>Da Aka Haɗa</strong> (Ba Sakamakon Bincike ba) daga rumbun bayanai.  Za a sake tattara bayanai bisa <strong>sababbin bayanan da aka bincika kaɗai</strong> a zagayen Mai Tattara Bayanai na mactrack na gaba."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes ALL <strong>Aggregated</strong> (Not Scan Results) Port to MAC to IP associations from the database and their re-creation based on <strong>All scanned data</strong> now."
msgstr "Yana share DUKKAN haɗin Port zuwa MAC zuwa IP <strong>Da Aka Haɗa</strong> (Ba Sakamakon Bincike ba) daga rumbun bayanai da sake ƙirƙirar su bisa <strong>Dukkan bayanan da aka bincika</strong> yanzu."

