#: setup.php
msgid "Switch/Hub, Switch/Router Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Switch/Hub, Switch/Router"

#: setup.php
msgid "Provide a list of ports on a specific switch/hub whose MAC results should be ignored.  Ports such as link/trunk ports that can not be distinguished from other user ports are examples.  Each port number must be separated by a colon, pipe, or a space ':', '|', ' '.  For example, 'Fa0/1: Fa1/23' or 'Fa0/1 Fa1/23' would be acceptable for some manufacturers switch types."
msgstr "Bayar da jerin tashoshi a kan takamaiman switch/hub waɗanda ya kamata a yi watsi da sakamakon su na MAC. Tashoshi kamar tashoshin link/trunk da ba za a iya bambance su da sauran tashoshin masu amfani ba misalai ne. Dole ne a raba kowace lambar tasha da madaurin digo biyu, sanda, ko sarari ':', '|', ' '. Misali, 'Fa0/1: Fa1/23' ko 'Fa0/1 Fa1/23' za su yi daidai ga wasu nau'ikan switch na masana'antu."

#: setup.php
msgid "You can use specific SNMP settings or select SNMP set. In the second case, mactrack tries to find correct settings from SNMP set"
msgstr "Za ka iya amfani da takamaiman saitunan SNMP ko ka zaɓi saitin SNMP. A yanayi na biyu, mactrack yana ƙoƙarin nemo saitunan da suka dace daga saitin SNMP"

