msgstr "Dukkan Abubuwan da Suka Faru"

#: setup.php
msgid "Every Hour"
msgstr "Kowace Awa"

#: setup.php
msgid "Email Addresses"
msgstr "Adiresoshin Imel"

#: setup.php
msgid "Enter a semicolon separated of Email addresses that will be notified where this MAC address is."
msgstr "Shigar da jerin adiresoshin Imel da aka raba da waƙafi mai ɗigo waɗanda za a sanar da su inda wannan adireshin MAC yake."

#: setup.php
msgid "General Mac Address Authorization Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Izinin Adireshin MAC na Gabaɗaya"

#: setup.php
msgid "MAC Address Match"
msgstr "Dacewar Adireshin MAC"

#: setup.php
msgid "Please enter the MAC Address or Mac Address Match string to be automatically authorized.  If you wish to authorize a group of MAC Addresses, you can use the wildcard character of '&#37;' anywhere in the MAC Address."
msgstr "Da fatan za a shigar da Adireshin MAC ko jimlar Daidaita Adireshin MAC don a ba da izini ta atomatik.  Idan kana son ba da izini ga rukunin Adiresoshin MAC, za ka iya amfani da harafin daji na '&#37;' a ko'ina cikin Adireshin MAC."

#: setup.php
msgid "Please add a reason for this entry."
msgstr "Da fatan za a ƙara dalili don wannan shigarwar."

